{"parentUuid":"7fd273d5-4308-4714-add9-ee755d105349","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b2fe1615-f94f-43d1-aa93-685871ecac2b","agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LahGdTVBXLVzprMhfBVAyH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Anthropic Max subscription $200 API credits promotion 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Anthropic API Pricing in 2026: Complete Guide — Models, Caching, Batch & Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Is Now Charging Per Token for Third-Party Tools on Max and Pro | RelayPlane Blog\",\"url\":\"https://relayplane.com/blog/anthropic-extra-usage-third-party-tools\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Offers Free Usage Credits to Celebrate New Bundles — Up to $200 for Pro and Team Plans\",\"url\":\"https://www.agent-wars.com/news/2026-04-04-anthropic-free-usage-credits-promotion\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Gives Claude Pro, Max, and Team Subscribers Free ...\",\"url\":\"https://megaoneai.com/analysis/anthropic-gives-claude-pro-max-and-team-subscribers-free-usage-credits-up-to-200/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Pricing 2026: Pro, Max, API Costs Explained | Get AI Perks\",\"url\":\"https://www.getaiperks.com/en/ai/claude-code-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"How to Use Claude AI for Free: All Options for Developers in 2026 - Verdent Guides\",\"url\":\"https://www.verdent.ai/guides/how-to-use-claude-ai-for-free-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Pricing 2026: Free Credits, API Costs & Max Plan Explained | NxCode\",\"url\":\"https://www.nxcode.io/resources/news/claude-code-pricing-2026-free-api-costs-max-plan\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Pricing 2026: $20 Pro vs $100/$200 Max — Real Math\",\"url\":\"https://findskill.ai/blog/claude-code-subscription-pricing-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Plans & Pricing | Claude by Anthropic\",\"url\":\"https://claude.com/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic is spending $5,000 to serve your $200 plan — bug or master plan?\",\"url\":\"https://www.aaronsnewsletter.com/p/anthropic-is-spending-5000-to-serve\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about Anthropic's $200 API credits promotion in 2026:\n\nAnthropic is offering one-time extra usage credits to Pro, Max, and Team plan subscribers to celebrate the launch of its new usage bundles, with credits ranging from $20 (Pro) to $200 (Team, Max 20x).\n\nMore specifically, Pro plan users can claim $20 in credits, while Max 5x subscribers receive $100, and both Max 20x and Team plan subscribers get $200.\n\n**Key details about the promotion:**\n\n- Users must enable extra usage and claim the credit between April 3-17, 2026, and credits expire 90 days after claiming\n- To be eligible, users must have subscribed by April 3, 2026 at 9 AM PT\n- The credits work across all Claude products and surfaces: the web chat interface, Claude Code, Claude Cowork, and third-party applications that integrate Claude's API\n- Enterprise plans and Console accounts are excluded from this promotion\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"5ff55d6e-18ec-4255-8072-7b64682779cb","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:34:48.445Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7fd273d5-4308-4714-add9-ee755d105349","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"5c920799-13a4-4851-b7e4-41675cbcbd76","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b2fe1615-f94f-43d1-aa93-685871ecac2b","agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0146FdYbhgg9hc8UMkdiJ2wc","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemini API free tier rate limits 2026 RPM RPD models\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier Rate Limits 2026: Is the 20 RPD ...\",\"url\":\"https://blog.laozhang.ai/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"Rate limits | Gemini API | Google AI for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier: Complete Guide to Rate Limits, Models & Getting Started (2026) | YingTu\",\"url\":\"https://yingtu.ai/en/blog/gemini-api-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Rate Limits 2026: Complete Per-Tier Guide with All Models - Complete Rate Limit Guide for Free, Tier 1, Tier 2, and Enterprise | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-api-rate-limits-per-tier\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier 2026: 1,500 Req/Day, 1M TPM — No Card - TokenMix Blog\",\"url\":\"https://tokenmix.ai/blog/gemini-api-free-tier-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier Rate Limits: Complete Guide for 2026 - All Models, All Limits, Plus December 2025 Updates | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier-rate-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier Complete Guide: Rate Limits, Upgrade Path & Cost-Saving Strategies (2026) - Every Model, Every Limit, Every Strategy to Save Money on Google's AI API | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier-complete-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Rate Limits Explained: Complete 2026 Guide to All Tiers, Models & Best Practices | YingTu\",\"url\":\"https://yingtu.ai/en/blog/gemini-api-rate-limits-explained\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier 2026: Limits, Quotas, and What You Actually Get\",\"url\":\"https://pecollective.com/tools/gemini-free-tier-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Rate limits - Google Gemini API\",\"url\":\"https://gemini-api.apidog.io/doc-965865\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, here's information about Gemini API free tier rate limits in 2026:\n\n## Current Free Tier Rate Limits (2026)\n\nThe three models available on the free tier as of March 2026 are Gemini 2.5 Pro with 5 RPM and 100 requests per day, Gemini 2.5 Flash with 10 RPM and 250 daily requests, and Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite which leads the pack with 15 RPM and 1,000 daily requests. All three models share a 250,000 tokens-per-minute limit and full access to the 1-million-token context window.\n\n## Key Details About Rate Limits\n\nRequests per minute (RPM) caps how many individual API calls you can make within any 60-second window, regardless of request size. Tokens per minute (TPM) limits the total number of tokens (input and output combined) processed in a minute, controlling computational load. Requests per day (RPD) sets an overall daily ceiling that resets at midnight Pacific Time.\n\nA critical detail that trips up many developers: rate limits apply at the project level, not per API key. Creating multiple API keys within the same Google Cloud project does not multiply your quota. If you need genuinely separate quotas, you must create separate Google Cloud projects, each with its own billing and configuration.\n\n## Important Note\n\nOn December 7, 2025, Google reduced free tier quotas by 50-80%, making optimization strategies essential for developers who rely on free access.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"b4da8111-dddc-429c-9f54-f420f4240f53","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:34:50.254Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5c920799-13a4-4851-b7e4-41675cbcbd76","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"66605f6e-557c-477f-8a6d-38cf3f31e049","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b2fe1615-f94f-43d1-aa93-685871ecac2b","agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017ub4GQM1QYXzxKkjCTG7Em","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemini API free tier privacy training data 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier: Complete Guide to Rate Limits, Models & Getting Started (2026) | YingTu\",\"url\":\"https://yingtu.ai/en/blog/gemini-api-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier 2026: 1,500 Req/Day, 1M TPM — No Card - TokenMix Blog\",\"url\":\"https://tokenmix.ai/blog/gemini-api-free-tier-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier Complete Guide: Rate Limits, Upgrade Path & Cost-Saving Strategies (2026) - Every Model, Every Limit, Every Strategy to Save Money on Google's AI API | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier-complete-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier 2026: Limits, Quotas, and What You Actually Get\",\"url\":\"https://pecollective.com/tools/gemini-free-tier-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Privacy of data in tier 1 - Gemini API - Google AI Developers Forum\",\"url\":\"https://discuss.ai.google.dev/t/privacy-of-data-in-tier-1/102251\"},{\"title\":\"Google AI Studio Pricing 2026: Free Tier, API Costs & Plans\",\"url\":\"https://www.nocode.mba/articles/google-ai-studio-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier Rate Limits 2026: Is the 20 RPD ...\",\"url\":\"https://blog.laozhang.ai/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"How Gemini for Google Cloud uses your data | Google Cloud Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini/docs/discover/data-governance\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Pricing: Free Tier Limits + April 2026 Changes | FindSkill.ai — Learn AI for Your Job\",\"url\":\"https://findskill.ai/blog/gemini-api-pricing-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Pricing Calculator & Cost Guide (May 2026)\",\"url\":\"https://costgoat.com/pricing/gemini-api\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the Gemini API free tier, privacy, and training data in 2026:\n\n## Free Tier Access\n\nGoogle's Gemini API free tier provides developers with access to three stable AI models—Gemini 2.5 Pro, 2.5 Flash, and 2.5 Flash-Lite—at zero cost and without requiring a credit card. Rate limits range from 5 to 15 requests per minute and 100 to 1,000 requests per day, with a universal cap of 250,000 tokens per minute across all models.\n\n## Privacy and Training Data\n\nThe key privacy consideration for the free tier is that on the free tier, Google's terms allow using your API inputs and outputs to improve their models. On the free tier, your prompts and responses may be used to improve Google products. This makes the free tier inappropriate for applications handling sensitive user data, proprietary business information, or any content subject to privacy regulations.\n\nIn contrast, Tier 1 (paid tier) does not use your data for training, making it the appropriate choice if data privacy is a requirement.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nStay on the Free Tier if your application makes fewer than 100 API calls per day and you are comfortable with your data being used to improve Google products. The free tier is ideal for personal projects, prototyping, academic research, and low-volume internal tools.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"3c97d57f-02ee-44cc-a21a-dcdd50d2e797","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:34:50.482Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"66605f6e-557c-477f-8a6d-38cf3f31e049","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"4e869021-f12c-49b5-9c30-795d0dd0ebec","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b2fe1615-f94f-43d1-aa93-685871ecac2b","agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Msk3rELQGxDarzFuwrnfRS","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Anthropic Max plan API credits bonus 2025 2026 how to claim\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Anthropic's Limited-Time Giveaway! Claim Up to $200 Free Credits for Claude Pro/Max/Team | Elegant Access\",\"url\":\"https://elegantaccess.org/en/posts/2026-04-07-anthropic-claude-free-credit-claim/\"},{\"title\":\"How to Claim Free Claude Code Credits: $250 for Pro, $1000 for Max Subscribers\",\"url\":\"https://apidog.com/blog/claude-code-free-credits/\"},{\"title\":\"How to Get a Free Anthropic API Key in 2026 (Plus Free Credits) | Get AI Perks\",\"url\":\"https://www.getaiperks.com/en/ai/free-anthropic-api-key\"},{\"title\":\"How to Get Free Anthropic Credits in 2026 | Get AI Perks\",\"url\":\"https://www.getaiperks.com/en/blogs/17-free-anthropic-credits\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Is Now Charging Per Token for Third-Party Tools on Max and Pro | RelayPlane Blog\",\"url\":\"https://relayplane.com/blog/anthropic-extra-usage-third-party-tools\"},{\"title\":\"How to Access Claude for Free in 2026 - salesso.com\",\"url\":\"https://salesso.com/blog/how-to-access-claude-projects-final/\"},{\"title\":\"How to Get Free Anthropic API Credits in 2026 | Get AI Perks\",\"url\":\"https://www.getaiperks.com/en/ai/how-to-get-free-anthropic-api-credits\"},{\"title\":\"Pricing - Claude API Docs\",\"url\":\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"How to Get $5 in Free Anthropic Claude API Credits (2026)\",\"url\":\"https://aicreditmart.com/ai-credits-providers/how-to-get-5-in-free-anthropic-claude-api-credits-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Offers Free Usage Credits to Celebrate New Bundles — Up to $200 for Pro and Team Plans\",\"url\":\"https://www.agent-wars.com/news/2026-04-04-anthropic-free-usage-credits-promotion\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Anthropic Max plan API credits bonuses in 2025-2026:\n\n## Recent Promotions & How to Claim\n\nIn April 2026, Anthropic announced they would be distributing a one-time \"free usage credit\" to subscribers on active premium plans, with rewards going up to $200, to celebrate the launch of their new \"Usage Bundles\" billing tier.\n\n### Eligibility & Claiming Instructions\n\nTo qualify, you must have been an active subscriber of the Pro, Max, or Team plan before April 3, 2026, 9:00 AM (PT). \n\nYou must claim your credits via the web interface before April 17, 2026. For Pro/Max Users, navigate to Settings → Usage.\n\n### Credit Details\n\nOnce claimed, the credits are added directly to your account balance. They are valid for 90 days, and any unused portion will not roll over to the next period.\n\n## Previous Promotions\n\nA similar promotion in November 2025 gave Pro subscribers $250 in credits and Max subscribers $1,000 specifically for Claude Code sessions.\n\nThese promotions are announced through in-app banners and Anthropic's newsletter. If you're a subscriber, keeping an eye on your Usage page and inbox is worth the effort.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"2cc81400-156a-4aa4-97e4-238cd57df094","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:34:50.499Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4e869021-f12c-49b5-9c30-795d0dd0ebec","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
