{"parentUuid":"6a88fd65-06d8-45f7-adce-9ad8936fe271","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b2fe1615-f94f-43d1-aa93-685871ecac2b","agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QPx4QQhKjYBAnJtNrJakgT","type":"tool_result","content":"# Anthropic Free Credits Promotion Details\n\n**Claim Deadline:** April 17, 2026\n\n**Eligibility Requirements:**\n- Subscribed to Pro, Max, or Team plans by April 3, 2026 at 9 AM PT\n- Had \"extra usage setting enabled\" in account\n- Enterprise plans and Console accounts were excluded\n\n**Credit Amount by Plan:**\n- Pro: $20\n- Max 5x: $100\n- Max 20x and Team: $200\n\n**Availability Period:** \"The promotion runs from April 3 through April 17, 2026\" with claimed credits expiring 90 days after redemption.\n\n**Status:** Yes, this was a limited-time, one-time event that has already concluded. The promotion window closed on April 17, 2026, making it no longer available for new claims."}]},"uuid":"6b098ba5-dde6-4a97-8522-50938f8c4cde","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:35:00.253Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6a88fd65-06d8-45f7-adce-9ad8936fe271","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"eafdfb85-7878-4bef-8f1e-d722bb7091c4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b2fe1615-f94f-43d1-aa93-685871ecac2b","agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01368tBvbroE8hMXsAGGa1fD","type":"tool_result","content":"# Gemini API Free Tier Rate Limits\n\nBased on the provided documentation, **specific rate limit numbers for the Free tier are not disclosed**. The page states: \"Rate limits depend on a variety of factors (such as your usage tier) and can be viewed in Google AI Studio.\"\n\nTo access actual Free tier limits for Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash, and Flash-Lite, users must check the [AI Studio Rate Limit dashboard](https://aistudio.google.com/rate-limit).\n\n## Key Details Available:\n\n- Rate limits are measured across **RPM, TPM (input), and RPD** dimensions\n- \"Exceeding any of them will trigger a rate limit error\"\n- Limits vary by model and tier\n- \"Rate limits are more restricted for experimental and preview models\"\n\n## Data Training Policy:\n\nThe document provided **does not address whether free tier data is used for training**. This information is not included in the rate limits documentation excerpt.\n\nFor current Free tier specifications and data usage policies, you'll need to consult Google AI Studio directly or review the Terms of Service linked in the documentation."}]},"uuid":"5c1caded-c913-48aa-bb3c-f30b1889559b","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:35:04.146Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"eafdfb85-7878-4bef-8f1e-d722bb7091c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"bc2e3699-a24b-4385-8b79-0ea76e1da929","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b2fe1615-f94f-43d1-aa93-685871ecac2b","agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JFQ76rdLVucf5WbA9MEvnJ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemini API China mainland availability 2026 region restriction\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Gemini Not Available in Your Region? Root Causes and Complete Fix Guide (2026) | YingTu\",\"url\":\"https://yingtu.ai/en/blog/gemini-not-available-in-your-region\"},{\"title\":\"Available regions for Google AI Studio and Gemini API | Google AI for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/available-regions\"},{\"title\":\"How to Use Google Gemini in China: 6 Working Methods for 2026 (Complete Guide) - VPN, API Gateway, Third-Party Platforms & Chinese AI Alternatives | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/how-to-use-gemini-in-china\"},{\"title\":\"Annoyed by Gemini's Regional Restrictions? Don't Panic—Here's a Practical Step–by–Step Solution Guide! - PopAi\",\"url\":\"https://www.popai.pro/resources/ai-tools/annoyed-by-geminis-regional-restrictions-dont-panicheres-a-practical-stepbystep-solution-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini Access Issues & Regional Restrictions: Managing Your Google Account and Workspace Usage\",\"url\":\"https://workalizer.com/blog/apps-tools/gemini-access-challenges-a-google-workspace-experts-guide-to-regional-restrictions-and-account-management/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini Now Works in Hong Kong — But Developers Are Still Locked Out of the API - Beast Net\",\"url\":\"https://10beasts.net/gemini-hong-kong-api-blocked-vpn/\"},{\"title\":\"Where you can use the Gemini web app - Gemini Apps Help\",\"url\":\"https://support.google.com/gemini/answer/13575153?hl=en\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini Unblocked: How to Access Google Gemini Anywhere | AdsPower\",\"url\":\"https://www.adspower.com/blog/gemini-unblocked-access-google-gemini-anywhere\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini Regional Restrictions 2025: Complete Guide to Access from Any Country (API Gateway Solutions) - Bypass Gemini Geo-Blocks with API Gateway & VPN Solutions | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-regional-restrictions\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini iOS App Not Available in Your Region? Complete Fix Guide 2025 - 5 Working Methods for iPhone & iPad Users in Restricted Regions | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-ios-app-not-available-region\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Gemini API availability in mainland China in 2026:\n\n## Current Status\n\nAccording to Google's official documentation updated 2026-01-26, the Gemini API covers 200+ countries and regions, but mainland China is not on the supported list. Google has not made any substantive changes to its region restriction policy -- the list of unsupported regions remains essentially the same, meaning that regardless of which version Gemini updates to, users in mainland China will still need workarounds.\n\n## Region Restriction Mechanism\n\nGoogle enforces a multi-layer region detection mechanism for Gemini, combining IP geolocation, Google account registration region, and browser environment signals.\n\n## Access Solutions\n\nFor developers and businesses needing programmatic access, API gateway services represent the optimal balance of performance and cost, routing API requests through servers in supported regions while offering significant cost savings of 30-70% compared to official pricing.\n\nIt's important to note that the web app and the API are governed by separate regional policies and are being opened on separate timelines -- for example, while Gemini's web app was opened to Hong Kong users in March 2026, the API remains blocked there.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"800ecf2e-d4b4-4ce8-b599-28711a70e08b","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:35:06.181Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bc2e3699-a24b-4385-8b79-0ea76e1da929","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ec86876c-2e37-4e1b-ba65-909dd41f4052","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b2fe1615-f94f-43d1-aa93-685871ecac2b","agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CL8u6DThASB8UvAoALfzWx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemini API free tier reliability problems unstable 2026 user reports\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Why Your Gemini API Free Tier Stopped Working: Complete Fix Guide (2026)\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier-not-working\"},{\"title\":\"Google Gemini API Free Tier: Limits, Billing, Setup - March 2026 limits, billing rules, and 429 fixes | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/google-gemini-api-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini Tier 1 Billing Enabled but Still Getting Free Quotas (250 RPD)? Complete Fix Guide 2026 | YingTu\",\"url\":\"https://yingtu.ai/en/blog/gemini-tier-1-billing-free-quotas-250-rpd\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Rate Limits and 429 Errors (2026): How Tiers ...\",\"url\":\"https://blog.laozhang.ai/en/posts/gemini-api-rate-limits-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Rate Limits Explained: Complete 2026 Guide to All Tiers, Models & Best Practices | YingTu\",\"url\":\"https://yingtu.ai/en/blog/gemini-api-rate-limits-explained\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier: Complete Guide to Rate Limits, Models & Getting Started (2026) | YingTu\",\"url\":\"https://yingtu.ai/en/blog/gemini-api-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier Rate Limits 2026: Is the 20 RPD ...\",\"url\":\"https://blog.laozhang.ai/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Free Tier Rate Limits: Complete Guide for 2026 - All Models, All Limits, Plus December 2025 Updates | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier-rate-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Error Troubleshooting: Complete Guide to Fix 429, 400, 500 Errors (2026) | LaoZhang AI Blog\",\"url\":\"https://blog.laozhang.ai/en/posts/gemini-api-error-troubleshooting\"},{\"title\":\"Rate limits | Gemini API | Google AI for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what users are reporting about Gemini API free tier reliability issues in 2026:\n\n## Major Quota Reductions and Stability Issues\n\nGoogle reduced free tier limits by 80-92% in December 2025, breaking most existing integrations. Developers began reporting 429 errors in previously working applications starting December 6, 2025, with production systems failing mid-deployment and some teams estimating downtime costs of $500-$2,000 per hour.\n\n## Google's Official Position on Instability\n\nGoogle has described the free tier as \"unstable, best effort, might be turned off at any time and shouldn't be used for production.\" Google has explicitly described the free tier as \"unstable\" and warned that limits could change again without notice, so building critical functionality on free access carries risk.\n\n## Real-World Impact on Users\n\nGemini 2.5 Flash saw its daily request limit drop from approximately 250 requests to just 20-50 requests per day, an 80% reduction that broke numerous automation projects, with Home Assistant users reporting failures in video doorbell integrations and smart home automations. The community response included significant discussion on Hacker News and Reddit, with some users reporting moving to alternative providers like GroqCloud or deploying local models via Ollama for applications requiring higher reliability.\n\n## Billing Issues\n\nDevelopers enabling billing on their Google Cloud project expect rate limits to jump to Tier 1 capacity, but many discover their quotas remain stuck at 250 RPD or similar free tier values, a known issue where the most common fix involves switching from experimental model variants to stable or preview-paid variants.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"1ebaa568-05c4-4e92-b2a9-a3cdc17421de","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:35:08.214Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ec86876c-2e37-4e1b-ba65-909dd41f4052","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"1ebaa568-05c4-4e92-b2a9-a3cdc17421de","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a9d4b8fc01f24e9b9","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01A1XCrx7LSUS1sUznkCdVri","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Got enough verified data. The task is a one-shot 5-10 min audit, no need for task tracking. Compiling final report.\n\n---\n\n## Anthropic $200 promo credits\n- **现状 (2026-05)**: **已停**。Apr 3-17 2026 一次性活动，claim 窗口已关。下一次类似促销没官方预告，需等 Anthropic 再发新 bundle。\n- **怎么领（已过期，仅供回顾）**: Settings → Usage 里手动 claim，要先开 \"extra usage\"。\n- **谁能领**: Apr 3 9 AM PT 之前已订阅 Pro/Max/Team，Console / Enterprise 排除。Max 5x = $100，Max 20x + Team = $200。\n- **有效期**: claim 后 90 天。**即使你那时领了，到期日是 ~Jul 17 2026**——理论能 cover 500 iter PoC ($90-115)，但前提是当时已 claim。没 claim 就废了。\n- **历史先例**: 2025-11 还有一次 Pro $250 / Max $1000 Claude Code 专用 credits。说明 Anthropic 大约半年一波促销，但**不是 Max 订阅自动福利**，必须实时盯邮件 + Usage 页 banner。\n\n## Gemini API free tier\n- **2.5 Pro**: 5 RPM / 250K TPM / **100 RPD**\n- **2.5 Flash**: 10 RPM / 250K TPM / **250 RPD**（2025-12 前是 1500，砍 80-83%）\n- **2.5 Flash-Lite**: 15 RPM / 250K TPM / **1000 RPD**\n- **隐私**: free tier **input + output 都会被用于 Google 模型训练**，paid Tier 1 起豁免。敏感数据/proprietary code 不能上 free tier。\n- **region**: **大陆 + 香港 API 都被 block**（Web app HK 已开但 API 没开）。需 VPN 或第三方 gateway，违反 Google ToS 风险。\n- **不靠谱具体表现**: (a) Google 官方文档**明文写 \"unstable, best effort, might be turned off at any time, shouldn't be used for production\"**；(b) 2025-12-07 单方面砍 50-80% quota，存量集成集体 429；(c) 启用 billing 后 quota 不自动升 Tier 1，要换模型 variant。\n- **500 iter PoC 能塞吗**: 假设 10K input + 5K output / iter = 15K token / iter，单 iter ≈ 1 request：\n  - 2.5 Pro: 100 RPD → **5 天才跑完** 500 iter，Pro 模型 OK\n  - 2.5 Flash: 250 RPD → 2 天，但质量不如 Pro\n  - TPM 250K 够单请求 (15K << 250K) 不成瓶颈\n  - 真正杀手是 **RPD 100 + 训练数据政策**——隔夜跑 5 天且代码可能进 Google 训练集\n\n## verdict\n- **$200 promo: 不推荐路径**——已过期，且 PoC 这种 ad-hoc 项目不能赌下次促销时机。如果你 4 月领过且没花，现在还能用 cover PoC。否则忽略。\n- **Gemini free tier: 不推荐 production**——data-for-training + 大陆 block + Google 自己说 \"unstable\" 三连，PoC 都够呛。如果一定要白嫖，用 2.5 Flash-Lite 1000 RPD（够，但模型最弱），且**不能放 proprietary 求解器代码**进 prompt。\n- **production 路径优先级**: \n  1. 直接付 Anthropic API ($90-115 单次 PoC，可控、隐私干净、和 Claude Code 同 model family 复现性最好) \n  2. Gemini **paid Tier 1**（开 billing 后 Pro RPM/RPD 升一档 + 训练豁免，钱比 Anthropic 便宜约 50%）\n  3. Gemini free tier（仅作连通性 smoke test，别跑真 PoC）\n  4. 蹲下一次 Anthropic 促销（不可控，不能纳入计划）\n\n## R13 同款风险点\n- **\"Max 含 $200 credits\"是季节性促销不是订阅福利**——audit `abd0d088248413ba4` 措辞如果被读成\"Max 用户随时可领\"会翻车，必须标注\"2026-04 一次性事件，已过期\"。\n- **Gemini free tier 砍 quota 是单方面、零预警**——把 PoC 工期算在 free tier 1500 RPD（2025 老数据）会算错，现在是 100-1000。\n- **Gemini paid Tier 1 启用 billing ≠ quota 自动升**——要换模型 variant 才生效。如果 PoC 直接刷信用卡跑就翻车，得先在 AI Studio 验证 quota 已升。\n- **Gemini API 大陆 block 是 IP + 账号注册地双层检测**——VPN 单层不够，gateway 转发违反 ToS 可能封号。如果生产机在国内得提前选好 region 出口或换路径。\n- **Anthropic API 和 Max 订阅是分账户**——即使你领过 $200 credits，那是 console.anthropic.com 余额，跟 OpenEvolve 调用同一个 key，但 Claude Code (Max 订阅) 用的另一条 quota 通道，两边互不冲抵。这点 audit 没强调容易混。\n\nSources:\n- [Anthropic Free Credits Promotion (Agent Wars)](https://www.agent-wars.com/news/2026-04-04-anthropic-free-usage-credits-promotion)\n- [Elegant Access — Anthropic Claim Guide](https://elegantaccess.org/en/posts/2026-04-07-anthropic-claude-free-credit-claim/)\n- [Gemini API Rate Limits (Google official)](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits)\n- [Available regions for Google AI Studio and Gemini API](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/available-regions)\n- [Gemini Free Tier 2026 Guide (YingTu)](https://yingtu.ai/en/blog/gemini-api-free-tier)\n- [Gemini Free Tier Not Working — Dec 2025 quota cut](https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-api-free-tier-not-working)\n- [Gemini Privacy / Tier 1 (Google AI Dev Forum)](https://discuss.ai.google.dev/t/privacy-of-data-in-tier-1/102251)\n- [How to Use Gemini in China (AI Free API)](https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/how-to-use-gemini-in-china)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5555,"cache_read_input_tokens":31202,"output_tokens":2362,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5555},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2362,"cache_read_input_tokens":31202,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5555,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5555,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat2f6HdcWrTRegGJ3CDa","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"4fa8de3d-b847-45d8-b6e9-63212666dfab","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:35:55.492Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
